# Lean changes

- Keep documentation and diagram changes lean.
- Do not install packages, or render Mermaid or Markdown, to validate documentation. GitHub renders Mermaid.
- Verify only what the change actually needs.
- Once the edit is done, commit and push rather than running extra checks.
- Do not spend tokens on work nobody asked for.
